    "Focus sessions (time, tree species, tags, grown or wilted), your settings (default duration, leave-grace seconds), and whether you unlocked Lifetime are saved locally with Apple’s on-device storage (SwiftData / similar). This data stays on your device unless you back up or transfer the device with your own Apple tools.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Focus sessions (time, tree species, tags, grown or wilted), your settings (default duration, leave-grace seconds), and whether you unlocked Lifetime are saved locally with Apple’s on-device storage (SwiftData / similar). This data stays on your device unless you back up or transfer the device with your own Apple tools."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "专注记录（时长、树种、标签、已长成或已枯萎）、你的设置（默认时长、离开宽限秒数），以及你是否已解锁终身版，都通过 Apple 的设备端存储（SwiftData 等）保存在本地。除非你使用 Apple 自己的工具备份或迁移设备，否则这些数据只会留在你的设备上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free stats cover the last 7 days. Unlock Month & Year charts, full history, and every tree species.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Free stats cover the last 7 days. Unlock Month & Year charts, full history, and every tree species."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "免费统计覆盖最近 7 天。解锁月度与年度图表、完整历史，以及全部树种。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
